@startuml
title FSM DSL-parser ParserCoordinatorActor

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> IDLE

IDLE --> WAITING_FOR_TOKENS : ParseDslRequest\n/ TokenizeDslRequest → LexerActor

WAITING_FOR_TOKENS : ожидаем результат лексера
WAITING_FOR_TOKENS --> WAITING_FOR_QUERY_AST : DslTokenized\n/ ParseTokenStreamRequest → QueryParserActor

WAITING_FOR_QUERY_AST : ожидаем DslQueryParsed
WAITING_FOR_QUERY_AST --> COMPLETED : DslQueryParsed\n/ forward to Collector
WAITING_FOR_QUERY_AST --> COMPLETED : DslParseFailed\n/ forward error

COMPLETED --> [*]

note right
  Источник: src/dsl/parsing/states.py (DslCoordinatorState).
  Внутренний FSM QueryParserActor с многошаговым разбором
  показан отдельно в state/dsl-query-parser.puml.
end note

@enduml
